  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "TinyFlags.Grpc 0.1.0-alpha.3\n\n      Added\n      - Reference gRPC transport: registration plus real-time push value synchronization over a Watch stream.\n      - Automatic reconnect on transient failures; permanent failures surface as TinyFlagsClientException.\n      - Strict response validation, consistent with the HTTP transport's failure classification (docs/grpc-protocol.md).\n\n      Fixed\n      - README/docs still said \"not yet published to NuGet.org\" after alpha.2 had actually shipped.\n\n      Compatibility\n      - Early alpha, matches TinyFlags's contract version.\n      - Upgrade TinyFlags, TinyFlags.Http and TinyFlags.Grpc together.",
